# Response headers for the deployed style guide (Cloudflare static assets). It is open to anyone who
# has the address and holds nothing private; it stays out of search engines all the same. It has no
# Content-Security-Policy: Storybook's preview frame can't run under the game's.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
